{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/27cebf5df90020248bbd956bc397d284.avif?t=1755361134\" width=1360 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extinction Core: World War Kaiju is a third-person aerial shooter that blending roguelite progression with epic boss-based aerial combat. Step into the cockpit of a customized fighter jet and take on towering Kaiju before they wipe out humanity. There are three pilots to choose from, two aircrafts, and endless load-out options to evolve, experiment and iterate your build through roguelite aerial combat gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/6efd193119ef1b351cbd702916ffa6b5.avif?t=1755361134\" width=1360 height=6150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/aa708b21c693265b86a655ef636ad260.avif?t=1755361134\" width=1360 height=270 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/f759dc93893087b19fe429bb366e9fae.avif?t=1755361134\" width=1360 height=5290 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/27cebf5df90020248bbd956bc397d284.avif?t=1755361134\" width=1360 height=314 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/f9d90bb2590e7b3a184ecce7e0c80177.avif?t=1755361134\" width=1360 height=724 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Extinction Core is 